  <item>
    <title>Vol-56 她的生活我的梦：00后女生在澳大利亚的打工生活！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b9586097178f08ee408345</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b9586097178f08ee408345</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 09:37:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>SHOW NOTES：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>今天故事的主人公是来自江苏的23岁女生栗子（Joy），在结束本科生活又拿到研究生名额后，毅然决然决定去澳洲打工旅行。在澳洲的四个月她送过外卖，做过服务生，住过农场也睡过沙发。问她初心是什么，她告诉我只是不想那么顺着社会时钟生活。欢迎收听她的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS:节目录制于9月1日，发布这天栗子应该已经顺利回国了~</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><span>小红书：糖炒栗子（勇闯澳洲版）</span></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>WHV:</span></strong><span>是澳洲新西兰两国针对国情对其他国家开放的打工-旅行签证</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>Time Line：</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> 什么是working holiday(visa)</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 对澳生活的美好幻想和冰冷现实</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a> 开启在澳的第一份工作</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 对不起jack，我不是故意送错餐的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 一边打工一边玩，挣得到底够花吗？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a> 在澳洲不同住宿的体验</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 一些在澳洲的想家时刻</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 在国外你也会吃预制菜</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 一路经历感受到的变化</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 回国后的未来计划</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3485">58:05</a> 如何形容在澳的时光</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3551">59:11</a> 给whver的5点建议</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>MUSIC:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>The Precious Moments We Share--Evan call</span></p><span></span><p><span>Journey of a Lifetime--Evan call</span></p><span></span><p><span>The End of One Journey--Evan call</span></p>]]></description>
